                <note rend="inline" type="source">561.333D3/1600: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Brazil</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Caffery</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Rio de
                                Janeiro</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1943-11-25T19:00:00-03:00">November 25, 1943—7
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 9:01 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>5482. Department’s 4318, November 20, 4 p.m. Souza Costa is definitely concerned
                    over the coffee situation and intends to do something about it after the debt
                    plan is settled, possibly early next week.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Caffery</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
